            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 9,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Halrad",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad_II.webp",
            text: _("Dacyn?! At last some good news! I thought you were long dead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Halric",
            text: _("He certainly looks half-dead. Dacyn, there is an unholy pall over your skin. Where have you been all this time? We’ve sorely needed your help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("My story and appearance are irrelevant. What matters is that I know how to defeat these invaders. The only path to victory is cutting off the head of the snake. Mal-Ravanal, who you once knew as the mage Ravan, must be destroyed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Aeraeka",
            text: _("You think we haven’t tried?! Our best mages struck down that infernal lich at great cost to their number, but within seconds, Mal-Ravanal had already taken a new body and returned the favor on our ranks. I myself barely made it out alive!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("And that is why my companions and I have spent the past year traveling far to the northeast, seeking (cough) a potent magical amulet that I now possess. If we can destroy the skeletal body, I wield the power to banish the lich’s long-tortured soul. This destruction will be permanent."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Your Majesty, I have seen this amulet used before. While I cannot attest to its reliability, it is certainly powerful enough to do what Dacyn claims."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Halric",
            text: _("Even assuming this magical voodoo works, how do you mean to destroy Mal-Ravanal’s body? The one chance we had was out of the lich’s own arrogance, and even that cost us four of our elite magi under better conditions. Now we’ve been cut off from Dan’Tonk and barely have enough men to hold the walls, much less sortie against the undead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Aeraeka",
            text: _("Truly, have you three not seen the might of the armies encircling Weldyn? It is as if all of the dead warriors from all ages past have come back to attack us. There is no end to the columns of marching skeletons, the wailing ghosts, the infernal bats, the necromancers who raised them..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("I pay no heed to the odds! I say we strike at Mal-Ravanal with all the might of Wesnoth. If we assault in force, we can punch through the enemy lines, isolate Mal-Ravanal in the chaos of battle, and blast the lich to oblivion! I will not let the devastation at the plains be the final legacy of the Clans. We must attack and win back our glory!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("I have a (cough) superior suggestion. Mal-Ravanal’s armies are vast and unconquerable. Yet the lich alone is not. As a human, Ravan was overconfident to the point of arrogance. I still believe this to be true, if not more so after gaining lichdom. (cough)(cough) If I were to challenge Mal-Ravanal to a duel, I believe they would choose to face me. That would be our opportunity."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("You call Mal-Ravanal arrogant, yet you seek to face such an overwhelming power in single combat? Even if you could claim victory with that foul amulet of yours, we cannot trust that lich to honor the terms of such a challenge. You would likely find yourself facing their entire army!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("We face their entire army regardless. (cough)(cough) The only difference is whether Mal-Ravanal is commanding in the back or gloating in the front."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad_II.webp",
            text: _("Two risky plans. But the armies surrounding Weldyn grow each day, and we are hard-pressed for options."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Halrod",
            type: "General",
            side: 2,
            x: 9,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Halrod",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Escort",
            type: "Swordsman",
            side: 2,
            x: 8,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Escort",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Halrod",
            x: 9,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Escort",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "nw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Escort",
            x: 8,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Escort",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Halrod",
            text: _("Sire, we’re under attack! Undead have breached the perimeter earthworks and are massing around the outer villages. I think they mean to storm the moat at nightfall."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Halric",
            text: _("They attack again so soon?! The few men we have left are in no position to repel a concentrated assault!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad_II.webp",
            text: _("This is ill news indeed. We will have to cut our council short; Generals, Lieutenant, ready your men!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
